---
import Picture from '../Picture.astro';
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container-tight grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 md:gap-14 items-center">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-ink-100 aspect-square">
        <Picture src="keith-with-cocker-spaniel" size={800} alt="Keith Kershaw with a cocker spaniel in his home grooming salon" width={800} height={800} />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-coral-500">Meet Keith</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">From the law to the grooming table.</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>After a successful career in law, Keith and his wife welcomed two golden retriever brothers — Ringo and Rolo — into their lives during lockdown. What followed was a crash course in just how much mischief two exuberant retrievers can find: mud, puddles, unidentifiable countryside discoveries, and more baths than anyone had bargained for.</p>
        <p>Somewhere in all that, Keith discovered he loved the grooming process — the calm of it, the care, the transformation at the end. He went on to qualify with the IPET Network at Mrs B's Grooming Academy in Leeds, where his trainers noted his natural ability to put dogs at ease.</p>
        <p>Keith brings the same professionalism and attention to detail to every groom that he has applied throughout his working life. Your dog is in safe, experienced hands.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-ghost mt-6">
        Read Keith's full story
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
